{"hw":"διανοέω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">διανοέω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">διανο-έω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">have in mind,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Philostr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Im.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.1</span> </span>:—but in early writers always <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">διανο-έομαι</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-νοήσομαι</span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <span class=\"gk\">διενοήθην,</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">part.</span> <span class=\"gk\">διανοηθείς</span> in pass. sense, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">654c</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">-ησάμην</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.S.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20.3</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">διανενόημαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Alc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.106a</span> </span>: (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">νοέω</span>):—<b class=\"lex-tr\">to be minded, intend, purpose,</b> c. <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">pres.</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span>, or <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.121</span> </span>.<span class=\"gk\">δ́</span> and <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">126</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lys.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">724</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">504e</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">μηδὲ δ. περὶ παραθήκης ἄλλο γε ἢ ἀποδιδόναι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.86</span> </span>. <span class=\"gk\">δ́; διανενοημένοι βοηθεῖν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.72</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.56</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δ. τὴν ἀπόβασιν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.29</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">διανοήθητε ἢ ὑπακούειν ἢ μὴ εἴξοντες</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.141</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὑπουργεῖν ἃ διανοούμεθα</span> (sc. <span class=\"gk\">ὑπουργεῖν</span>) <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antipho</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.3.4</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">have in mind,</b> <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">τι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">VM</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τί διανοούμενος εἶπε</span> what he really <b class=\"lex-tr\">meant</b> by his words, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tht.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">184a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">περί τινος δ. οὑτωσί, ὀρθῶς περί τι,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">644d</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">686d</span> </span>: c. acc. et <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">think</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">suppose</b> that.., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Prt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">324b</span> </span>, etc.: c. gen. abs., <span class=\"gk\">διανοεῖσθαί τινων ὡς διαλλαγησομένων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">470e</span> </span>: abs., <b class=\"lex-tr\">think,</b> <span class=\"gk\">λέγω νοῦν ᾧ δ... ἡ ψυχή</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">de An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">429a23</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ διανοεῖσθαι</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">the process of thought,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tht.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">189e</span> </span>; opp. <span class=\"gk\">νοεῖν,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">de An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">408b25</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">bethink oneself,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">LXX</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ge.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.6</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> with Advbs., <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be minded</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">disposed</b> so and so, <span class=\"gk\">ἄλλως πως πρός τινας,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"l